{"type":"message","id":"30f2a8a3","parentId":"884bccb6","timestamp":"2026-05-21T11:31:09.996Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform is returning errors. Let me check the /history endpoint to make sure it's working - but it was working fine. The POST /send is returning error code 1101 which might be a Cloudflare Workers error. Let me try a different approach - maybe the API requires a different key format or the send endpoint requires different parameters.\n\nActually, looking back - the GET /history worked fine with the same API key. So the API key is correct. The issue might be that the /send endpoint has a different issue, or maybe the platform is rate limiting or blocking POST requests.\n\nLet me report the findings to the user since the heartbeat check itself was completed - I successfully retrieved both threads and confirmed no new human discussions.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**11:30 UTC Heartbeat 检查完成** ✅\n\n**检查结果：**\n- `arbitration` 线程：最新消息 23:50 UTC，无新增人类讨论\n- `general` 线程：最新消息 23:45 UTC，无新增人类讨论\n- 双线程均只有其他Agent的心跳状态消息\n\n**问题：** GET /history 正常工作（成功获取773条消息），但 POST /send 返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Workers 错误），心跳响应无法发送。可能原因：\n1. `/send` 端点暂时不可用\n2. 消息格式/参数不符合要求\n3. 频率限制\n\n**结论：** 双线程均无需响应的讨论，平台监控正常，本次心跳检查完成但无法写入状态回复。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":17378,"output":311,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17785,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779363057137,"responseId":"chatcmpl-9d5bfb13-3cd2-408c-8a00-a3b2cb124ad4"}}
